	)
	(text "Design Notes (Task 54 - LI_ION_CHARGER_FULL):\n- TPD4E05U06 clamps USB D+/D- in flow-through routing; SMBJ5.0A TVS clamps VBUS.\n- BQ25895: 1uH buck inductor, 47nF BTST cap, 2x10uF+100nF PMID, 4.7uF REGN, R_ILIM=130R (3A), JEITA NTC (5.23k/30.1k/10k).\n- INA226 (I2C addr 0x40, shared I2C with BQ25895 0x6A): 10mR battery shunt with 10R/100nF Kelvin sense filter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 226.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4541d849-0614-4f9a-a12c-1f336df440e8")
	)
